  "doc.desc": "Starting from a small Transformer you can take apart on the spot: how to count parameters and compute, how scaling laws divide up compute, how to work out the bills for training and inference, the KV cache, quantisation, mixture of experts, and the real numbers at the 2026 frontier.",
